hey im having a bit of a headache with aws. i'm trying to get a lambda function to write logs to an s3 bucket but i keep getting an Access Denied error in the cloudwatch logs even though i thought i set the policy up right. 

can u take a look at this policy?

{
  "Version": "2012-10-17",
  "Statement": [
    {
      "Effect": "Allow",
      "Action": [
        "s3:PutObject"
      ],
      "Resource": "arn:aws:s3:::my-log-bucket-12345"
    }
  ]
}

